Article 2 B of PO No. 149 of 1972 shall be citizen of Bangladesh. In the acquisition of such citizenship, the laws have made no discrimination in any way on the ground of ethnicity, language, sex etc. }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\b\i\lang1033\langfe2057\langnp1033\insrsid14316300\charrsid12005260 Members of the Urdu-speaking people wherever they live in Bangladesh if they answer the above qualifications shall become citizen of Bangladesh and in view 
