\par (ii) who was a permanent resident of the territories now comprised in Bangladesh on the 25 day of March, 1971 and continues to be so resident and is not otherwise disqualified for being a citizen by or under any law for the time being in force;
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\lang1033\langfe2057\langnp1033\insrsid4881695\charrsid7674796 Provided that if any person is a permanent resident of the territories now comprised 
